  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to purchase Project vehicle for CTP funded projects.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CTP is working with TOCH to implement Caritas Norway and ISCP projects in Gogrial East and West.  The projects continue to meet protection needs through Gender Based Violence (GBV) case management, strengthening referral pathways and psychosocial support groups. Advocacy work on GBV issues and Women&#x2019;s Empowerment will continue to be strengthened through PSS groups, engaging key stakeholders.
The purchase of another vehicle will support to supplement existing vehicles and motorbikes to ease project implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
